<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reset Password / PIN Code</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0B0F19;
      color: #F8FAFC;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #151C2C;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 36px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .logo-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      line-height: 56px;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid #F59E0B;
      border-radius: 28px;
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .brand-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #00F2FE;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94A3B8;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #F8FAFC;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .instructions {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #94A3B8;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .otp-card {
      background: #1E293B;
      border: 2px dashed #F59E0B;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 10px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .otp-code {
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 10px;
      color: #F59E0B;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }
    .timer-notice {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #EF4444;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .footer {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748B;
      border-top: 1px solid #1E293B;
      padding-top: 20px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo-badge">🔐</div>
    <div class="brand-title">EAZYPAY</div>
    <div class="subtitle">Password & PIN Reset Request</div>

    <div class="greeting">Hello {{name}},</div>
    <div class="instructions">We received a request to reset your EazyPay account passcode/PIN. Use the security code below to reset it:</div>

    <div class="otp-card">
      <div class="otp-code">{{otpCode}}</div>
      <div class="timer-notice">⏱️ Valid for 5 minutes only</div>
    </div>

    <div class="instructions" style="font-size: 12px; color: #EF4444;">
      If you did not initiate this request, someone may be attempting to access your wallet. Change your PIN immediately.
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EazyPay Inc. All rights reserved.<br>
      Automated Security Notification &bull; Do Not Reply
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
